From c17bad1a47509aca73c6601c2fbf4b5c943e6856 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 05:30:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Vesalo look, German greeting and a "Spiegeln" mirroring
 tile
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Clock in Fraunces SemiBold (Vesalo brand font, OFL), greeting and German
  date underneath ("Guten Abend · Dienstag, 10. November")
- Vesalo colours: accent #4ba3ff focus pill, #0c0c0d dock glass, #18181b menus
- "Spiegeln" tile at the end of the dock: opens AirScreen if installed,
  else Fire TV's own Miracast receiver, else explains hold-Home > Mirroring
- Updater points at this fork's releases (own signing key)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014FhJRcyxwvLSScWmo4WMDD
